OL,3,AI pay #250 a month for someone else to
OL,4,Ado my life admin - it's worth it
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaxine Dillion, a busy 44-year-old mum
OL,7,Fof two, was struggling with her life
OL,8,Fadmin ` the never-ending to-do list of
OL,9,Fhousehold and personal chores.
OL,11,FEverything from arranging for a
OL,12,Fhandyman to fix something, to posting
OL,13,Fher clothing returns on Vinted, she
OL,14,Fwasn't getting around to it.
OL,16,F"I felt like all the little jobs that I
OL,17,Fdidn't have time for were mounting up,"
OL,18,Fsays Maxine, who is self-employed
OL,19,Fhelping businesses with their use of
OL,20,Fsocial media.
